Package: lazybw
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Terminal-based Bitwarden vault manager
 LazyBW provides a terminal interface for managing Bitwarden
 vaults, editing items and folders, synchronizing remote changes,
 and accessing encrypted local vault replicas.
 .
 Requires the Bitwarden CLI (bw) for remote vault operations.
